{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26191","headline":"赋得花藤药合寄頴阴故人 · 朱昼","name":"赋得花藤药合寄頴阴故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藤生南海滨，引蔓青且长。\n剪削爲花枝，何人无文章。\n非才亦有心，割骨闻余芳。\n繁叶落何处，孤贞在中央。\n愿盛黄金膏，寄与青眼郎。\n路远莫知意，水深天苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}